            <p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 4px;">Under 85 mph</p>
            <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin:0;">Best balls for slow swing speed →</p>
          </a>
