            <p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 4px;">85–100 mph</p>
            <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin:0;">Best balls for mid swing speed →</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/best-golf-balls-2026/" style="display:block;padding:14px 16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);">
            <p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 4px;">100+ mph</p>
            <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin:0;">Best tour balls ranked →</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/best-golf-drivers-forgiveness/" style="display:block;padding:14px 16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);">
            <p style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 4px;">Best drivers</p>
            <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin:0;">Matched to your speed →</p>
