        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0;text-align:center;">All recommendations based on products we independently purchased and tested. <a href="/how-we-test/" style="color:var(--green);font-weight:600;">How we test →</a></p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
